***Project Pipeline***

The workflow follows a structured financial data processing pipeline.

AlphaVantage API
       │
       ▼
Fetch Fundamental Data
       │
       ▼
Missing Data Handling
(Smart Imputation)
       │
       ▼
Merge with Stock Prices
       │
       ▼
Feature Dataset Creation
       │
       ├── Top 20 Performer Analysis
       │
       └── Upward Movement Prediction


